    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40923" root="هجب" body-key="h">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجُبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجْبٌ</span>, <i>He drove,</i> or
<i>urged along.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, <i>He beat with a
stick,</i> or <i>staff.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجَبَ</span>, inf. n. as
above, <i>He was quick,</i> or <i>swift,</i> (K,) <i>in his pace
&amp;c.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  This art. is omitted by most of
the lexicographers, because not regarded by them
as of established authority. (TA.)

